    "description": "Natural Mineral Specimen Lot\nMixed Rough Stones and Geodes\n0.4 lbs\nThis collection features six diverse natural mineral specimens, suitable for jewelry making, lapidary work, or as display pieces. The lot includes various quartz varieties, a metallic pyrite specimen, and two crystalline geodes. These unpolished stones showcase a range of textures, from the sharp, sparkling druzy of the geodes to the metallic luster of the \"fool's gold.\"\nIncludes one hollow geode with white crystalline interior\nBrassy metallic pyrite specimen included\nClear to yellowish rough crystal specimen, possibly citrine or calcite\nTotal of 6 pieces varying in shape and size\nCondition:\nGood natural condition. These are raw, unpolished specimens and show natural variations in color, texture, and crystalline structure. The pyrite specimen shows characteristic metallic luster. Geodes are intact with visible internal crystals. Total weight as shown on scale is 0.415 lbs.\nAll items are sold as-is. Condition, completeness, and functionality may vary. Items may not be fully tested, authenticated, sorted, or inventoried unless explicitly stated in the listing. For bulk, lot, or miscellaneous listings, contents can include a mix of brands, types, and conditions, and there are no guarantees regarding specific items included.\nAutographs and signatures have not been authenticated unless otherwise noted.\nWatches and electronics may not be tested for full functionality and may only be tested for power on, if at all.\nDue to the nature of these items, no returns or refunds will be accepted for condition, completeness, or functionality. Buyers are responsible for reviewing all photos and descriptions and must address any questions or concerns prior to bidding or purchase. By placing a bid or completing a purchase, you agree to these terms.\nFor jewelry orders only:\nCombined shipping is available for multiple items but must be requested through customer service prior to completing payment. This process is not automatic, and no refunds will be issued for combined shipping after payment has been processed.\nPlease note:\nWhat is pictured is what is in the box/bag. As this is an assorted bulk jewelry items, there are no guarantees in regards to the items included and condition. This will contain some combination of mismatched, damaged, craft/costume jewelry, and accessories. Note that the auctions are typically shipped in bulk and not packaged individually. This auction is not available for closer examination or additional information or pictures beyond what has been disclosed. Coin lots have been sorted as to not contain any US coins or currency or non-monetary items. However, a few may be missed and could be included.\nNo returns or refunds will be accepted for this auction. By placing a bid on this auction, you accept this as a condition of the sale.\nOversized Prints, Paintings & Framed Artwork – Shipping Disclaimer\nSome oversized prints, paintings, and framed artwork may be listed as",
